      "writtenOn": "2026-02-09T11:04:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "@ptosi@google.com as it concerns you as well. What do you say? \n\nFor clock there\u0027s no reason to use a different HVC. Clock must be handled by the power domain on the host. If the power domain goes off, then the clock must be gated.\n\nHowever happy to future proff this thing. We could make arg2 a set of flags instead of bool? and then PWR_ON/PWR_OFF so it can be extended later?",
      "parentUuid": "9a948da5_048f0d07",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 566,
        "startChar": 10,
        "endLine": 566,
        "endChar": 32
      },
      "revId": "32163a35cbeb3b364c5d2e87cb3437c47db2f8b5",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
