        "id": 1965911
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-02-10T09:45:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s not only about clock gating, the guest might need to set clocks in different operation modes, or handle some other platform specific things that are not covered by the RPM (regulators for example)",
      "parentUuid": "e98daf33_778f2813",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 566,
        "startChar": 10,
        "endLine": 566,
        "endChar": 32
      },
      "revId": "32163a35cbeb3b364c5d2e87cb3437c47db2f8b5",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "2f10ec99_436d98e5",
        "filename": "arch/arm64/kvm/hyp/nvhe/device/device.c",
